{"teaching_intent":"让学生通过竖直绳圆周动画观察：速率随高度变化（非匀速），张力始终指向圆心且在最高点最小；通过调节最低点速度、质量、半径，对比最高点张力与模型给出的临界速度，理解“最高点张力余量”即恰好完成整周的判据，并借助动能/势能/机械能条理解能量守恒与速度变化的因果。时间轴区分物理时间与演示倍率，可慢放、暂停、拖动以定位最高点瞬间。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>通用圆周运动与竖直绳圆周模型</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;font-family:"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;background:#0f1623;color:#e8eef7}
header{padding:12px 16px;background:#17213a}
h1{font-size:18px;margin:0}
.sub{font-size:12px;color:#9db1d1;margin-top:4px}
main{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;padding:12px}
.stage{flex:1 1 340px;min-width:300px;background:#131c30;border-radius:12px;padding:10px}
svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
.legend{font-size:12px;color:#9db1d1;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.6}
.panel{flex:1 1 300px;min-width:280px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.card{background:#17213a;border-radius:12px;padding:12px}
.card h2{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#8fd0ff}
.ctl{margin:10px 0}
.ctl label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:2px}
input[type=range]{width:100%;height:44px;margin:0}
.row{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
button{min-height:44px;min-width:64px;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:#2b6cb0;color:#fff;font-size:14px;padding:0 16px;cursor:pointer}
button.rate{background:#26364f;min-width:56px}
button.rate.on{background:#2b6cb0}
.kv{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;padding:3px 0;gap:8px}
.kv span:last-child{text-align:right}
.bar{height:14px;background:#0e1524;border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;margin:4px 0 8px}
.bar i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:7px;transition:width .08s linear}
.top{margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:#ffd479;line-height:1.6}
@media(max-width:640px){main{padding:8px}.stage,.panel{min-width:0;flex:1 1 100%}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<!--HARNESS_PRIMITIVES-->
<!--HARNESS_MODEL-->
<!--HARNESS_INPUT-->
<header><h1>通用圆周运动与竖直绳圆周模型</h1><div class="sub">竖直绳圆周：速率随高度变化，张力在最高点最小——重点观察最高点张力余量</div></header>
<main>
<section class="stage">
<svg viewBox="-200 -200 400 400" aria-label="竖直圆周运动示意">
<defs>
<marker id="mV" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10z" fill="#59d99e"/></marker>
<marker id="mT" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10z" fill="#ff7b72"/></marker>
<marker id="mA" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10z" fill="#ffb454"/></marker>
</defs>
<circle cx="0" cy="0" r="100" fill="none" stroke="#3b4a6b" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"/>
<text x="0" y="-112" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ffd479" font-size="13">最高点</text>
<text x="0" y="126" text-anchor="middle" fill="#9db1d1" font-size="13">最低点 θ=0</text>
<circle cx="0" cy="0" r="4" fill="#8fd0ff"/>
<line id="rope" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="100" stroke="#cfd8ea" stroke-width="3"/>
<line id="vVec" x1="0" y1="100" x2="0" y2="100" stroke="#59d99e" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#mV)"/>
<line id="tVec" x1="0" y1="100" x2="0" y2="100" stroke="#ff7b72" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#mT)"/>
<line id="aVec" x1="0" y1="100" x2="0" y2="100" stroke="#ffb454" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#mA)"/>
<circle id="ball" cx="0" cy="100" r="12" fill="#4da3ff" stroke="#dff0ff" stroke-width="2"/>
</svg>
<div class="legend">绿箭头＝速度（切向）　红箭头＝绳张力（指向圆心）　橙箭头＝加速度。拖到最高点附近慢放，看红箭头还剩多长。</div>
</section>
<aside class="panel">
<div class="card"><h2>参数调节</h2>
<div class="ctl"><label><span>最低点速度 v₀</span><span id="labSpeed"></span></label><input id="ctlSpeed" data-control="speed_m_s" type="range" min="5" max="15" step="0.1"></div>
<div class="ctl"><label><span>小球质量 m</span><span id="labMass"></span></label><input id="ctlMass" data-control="mass_kg" type="range" min="0.1" max="1" step="0.05"></div>
<div class="ctl"><label><span>绳长（半径）r</span><span id="labRadius"></span></label><input id="ctlRadius" data-control="radius_m" type="range" min="0.5" max="2" step="0.05"></div>
</div>
<div class="card"><h2>时间控制</h2>
<div class="row"><button id="btnPlay" type="button">播放</button><button id="btnReplay" type="button" data-replay>重新播放</button></div>
<div class="row" style="margin-top:8px">
<button class="rate" type="button" data-rate="0.25">0.25×</button>
<button class="rate" type="button" data-rate="0.5">0.5×</button>
<button class="rate on" type="button" data-rate="1">1×</button>
<button class="rate" type="button" data-rate="2">2×</button>
<button class="rate" type="button" data-rate="4">4×</button>
</div>
<div class="kv"><span>物理时间</span><span id="physTime" data-physical-time>—</span></div>
<div class="kv"><span>演示倍率</span><span id="demoTime" data-demo-time>—</span></div>
<div class="kv"><span>周期（按 v(θ) 数值积分）</span><span id="periodInfo">—</span></div>
</div>
<div class="card" data-readout><h2>状态读数</h2>
<div class="kv"><span>位置角度 θ（最低点为 0°）</span><span id="roAng">—</span></div>
<div class="kv"><span>速率 v</span><span id="roV">—</span></div>
<div class="kv"><span>加速度大小 a</span><span id="roA">—</span></div>
<div class="kv"><span>绳张力 T</span><span id="roT">—</span></div>
<h2 style="margin-top:10px">最高点余量</h2>
<div class="kv"><span>最高点速率</span><span id="topV">—</span></div>
<div class="kv"><span>最高点张力（即余量）</span><span id="topT">—</span></div>
<div class="top" id="critInfo"></div>
</div>
<div class="card"><h2>能量</h2>
<div class="kv"><span>动能</span><span id="keVal">—</span></div><div class="bar"><i id="keBar" style="background:#59d99e;width:0"></i></div>
<div class="kv"><span>重力势能</span><span id="peVal">—</span></div><div class="bar"><i id="peBar" style="background:#4da3ff;width:0"></i></div>
<div class="kv"><span>机械能（守恒）</span><span id="meVal">—</span></div><div class="bar"><i id="meBar" style="background:#ffd479;width:0"></i></div>
</div>
</aside>
</main>
<script>
"use strict";
var H=globalThis.__HARNESS_INPUT__;
var base=H.scenario;
var $=function(id){return document.getElementById(id);};
var N=720;
var angles=[];
for(var i=0;i<=N;i++){angles.push(2*Math.PI*i/N);}
var scen=base,sample=null,times=[],period=1,timeline=null,playing=false;
var maxKE=1,maxPE=1,maxME=1;
var ctlS=$("ctlSpeed"),ctlM=$("ctlMass"),ctlR=$("ctlRadius");
function updLabels(){
 $("labSpeed").textContent=Number(ctlS.value).toFixed(1)+" m/s";
 $("labMass").textContent=Number(ctlM.value).toFixed(2)+" kg";
 $("labRadius").textContent=Number(ctlR.value).toFixed(2)+" m";
}
function scenFromControls(){
 return {G_n_m2_kg2:base.G_n_m2_kg2,central_mass_kg:base.central_mass_kg,g_m_s2:base.g_m_s2,mass_kg:Number(ctlM.value),mode:base.mode,radius_m:Number(ctlR.value),speed_m_s:Number(ctlS.value)};
}
function buildTimeMap(){
 var st=sample.states,r=scen.radius_m;
 times=[0];
 for(var i=0;i<N;i++){
  var v=(st[i].speed_m_s+st[i+1].speed_m_s)/2;
  times.push(times[i]+r*(angles[i+1]-angles[i])/Math.max(v,1e-6));
 }
 var k=period/times[N];
 for(var j=0;j<=N;j++){times[j]*=k;}
}
function stats(){
 maxKE=0;maxPE=0;maxME=0;
 sample.states.forEach(function(s){
  if(s.kinetic_j>maxKE)maxKE=s.kinetic_j;
  if(s.potential_j>maxPE)maxPE=s.potential_j;
  if(s.mechanical_j>maxME)maxME=s.mechanical_j;
 });
 if(maxKE<=0)maxKE=1;
 if(maxPE<=0)maxPE=1;
 if(maxME<=0)maxME=1;
}
function stateAt(t){
 var st=sample.states;
 var tau=t%period;
 if(tau<0)tau+=period;
 var lo=0,hi=N;
 while(hi-lo>1){var m=(lo+hi)>>1; if(times[m]<=tau)lo=m; else hi=m;}
 var t0=times[lo],t1=times[hi];
 var f=t1>t0?(tau-t0)/(t1-t0):0;
 var a=st[lo],b=st[hi];
 function L(x,y){return x+(y-x)*f;}
 return {ang:L(a.angle_rad,b.angle_rad),x:L(a.x_m,b.x_m),y:L(a.y_m,b.y_m),v:L(a.speed_m_s,b.speed_m_s),ax:L(a.ax_m_s2,b.ax_m_s2),ay:L(a.ay_m_s2,b.ay_m_s2),T:L(a.tension_n,b.tension_n),ke:L(a.kinetic_j,b.kinetic_j),pe:L(a.potential_j,b.potential_j),me:L(a.mechanical_j,b.mechanical_j)};
}
function cap(x,y,m){var l=Math.hypot(x,y); if(l>m&&l>0){return [x*m/l,y*m/l];} return [x,y];}
function setL(el,x1,y1,x2,y2){el.setAttribute("x1",x1);el.setAttribute("y1",y1);el.setAttribute("x2",x2);el.setAttribute("y2",y2);}
function draw(s){
 var sc=100/scen.radius_m;
 var bx=s.x*sc,by=-s.y*sc;
 var ball=$("ball");
 ball.setAttribute("cx",bx);ball.setAttribute("cy",by);
 setL($("rope"),0,0,bx,by);
 var c=Math.cos(s.ang),sn=Math.sin(s.ang);
 var vl=cap(c*s.v*7,-sn*s.v*7,85);
 setL($("vVec"),bx,by,bx+vl[0],by+vl[1]);
 var tn=Math.hypot(bx,by)||1;
 var td=cap(-bx/tn*s.T*4,-by/tn*s.T*4,90);
 setL($("tVec"),bx,by,bx+td[0],by+td[1]);
 var ad=cap(s.ax,-s.ay,90);
 setL($("aVec"),bx,by,bx+ad[0],by+ad[1]);
 var deg=((s.ang*180/Math.PI)%360+360)%360;
 $("roAng").textContent=deg.toFixed(0)+"°";
 $("roV").textContent=s.v.toFixed(2)+" m/s";
 $("roT").textContent=s.T.toFixed(2)+" N";
 $("roA").textContent=Math.hypot(s.ax,s.ay).toFixed(1)+" m/s²";
 $("keBar").style.width=(s.ke/maxKE*100)+"%";
 $("peBar").style.width=(s.pe/maxPE*100)+"%";
 $("meBar").style.width=(s.me/maxME*100)+"%";
 $("keVal").textContent=s.ke.toFixed(2)+" J";
 $("peVal").textContent=s.pe.toFixed(2)+" J";
 $("meVal").textContent=s.me.toFixed(2)+" J";
}
function render(st){
 $("physTime").textContent=CoursewarePrimitives.formatPhysicalTime(st.physicalTimeS);
 $("demoTime").textContent=CoursewarePrimitives.formatDemoRate(st.demoRate);
 playing=!!st.playing;
 $("btnPlay").textContent=playing?"暂停":"播放";
 draw(stateAt(st.physicalTimeS));
}
function topInfo(){
 var st=sample.states[N/2];
 $("topV").textContent=st.speed_m_s.toFixed(2)+" m/s";
 $("topT").textContent=st.tension_n.toFixed(2)+" N";
 var ev=sample.events;
 $("periodInfo").textContent=ev.period_s.toFixed(3)+" s";
 var msg="";
 if(ev.critical_bottom_speed_m_s!==undefined){
  msg="恰好完成整周所需：最低点临界速度 "+ev.critical_bottom_speed_m_s.toFixed(2)+" m/s，最高点临界速度 "+ev.critical_top_speed_m_s.toFixed(2)+" m/s。";
 }
 if(st.tension_n>0.05){msg+=" 当前最高点张力大于 0，绳子保持绷紧，余量充足。";}
 else{msg+=" 当前最高点张力接近 0，绳子接近松弛，处于临界附近。";}
 $("critInfo").textContent=msg;
}
function resample(first){
 scen=first?base:scenFromControls();
 sample=coursewareModel.sample({scenario:scen,angles_rad:angles});
 period=sample.events.period_s;
 buildTimeMap();
 stats();
 if(timeline){timeline.pause();}
 timeline=CoursewarePrimitives.createTimeline({durationPhysicalS:period,onChange:function(st){render(st);}});
 topInfo();
 render({physicalTimeS:0,demoRate:1,playing:false});
}
ctlS.value=base.speed_m_s;
ctlM.value=base.mass_kg;
ctlR.value=base.radius_m;
updLabels();
[ctlS,ctlM,ctlR].forEach(function(el){el.addEventListener("input",function(){updLabels();resample(false);});});
$("btnPlay").addEventListener("click",function(){if(!timeline)return; if(playing){timeline.pause();}else{timeline.play();}});
$("btnReplay").addEventListener("click",function(){if(timeline)timeline.replay();});
Array.prototype.forEach.call(document.querySelectorAll(".rate"),function(b){
 b.addEventListener("click",function(){
  if(timeline)timeline.setDemoRate(parseFloat(b.getAttribute("data-rate")));
  Array.prototype.forEach.call(document.querySelectorAll(".rate"),function(x){x.classList.remove("on");});
  b.classList.add("on");
 });
});
document.addEventListener("visibilitychange",function(){if(document.hidden&&timeline&&playing){timeline.pause();}});
resample(true);
</script>
</body>
</html>"}
